WEBVTT

00:01:51.066 --> 00:01:52.166
I wish you good luck in battle.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:56.170
We'll take back the Extra Seven
with our own hands.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.900
Let us meet again at that time.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.030
Stay well, Conrad!

00:02:01.366 --> 00:02:05.796
Yeah. I'm looking forward to the next time
that we get to fight together, Shu.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:07.770
Right!

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.200
Stay well!

00:02:15.666 --> 00:02:18.566
You too! Goodbye!

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.300
Thanks for everything.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.400
LOGI STRIKES

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.670
There it is!

00:02:30.466 --> 00:02:31.496
Wow!

00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:32.326
Maro!

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:40.373
Something's flashing.

00:02:41.433 --> 00:02:43.103
That's the Grankingdom.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:46.000
Kind of creepy.

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:47.433
Maro.

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:55.170
So that's the Grankingdom...

00:03:06.366 --> 00:03:10.126
Navigation speed, 280.
Maintaining an altitude of 180.

00:03:11.233 --> 00:03:12.233
Way past time...

00:03:12.266 --> 00:03:17.266
Huh? I think we will be able to arrive
at the meeting point on schedule.

00:03:17.766 --> 00:03:21.896
No. I was thinking it's about time
we capture our prey.

00:03:22.533 --> 00:03:27.273
Their presence was confirmed
during the Dragnov invasion earlier.

00:03:27.966 --> 00:03:30.826
If they were in Jibral, it should be
about time that they fall in my trap.

00:03:31.166 --> 00:03:33.426
Those Shadow Wielders, right?

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:35.970
We're receiving an incoming call
from Delphinium!

00:03:37.733 --> 00:03:39.133
The horseshoe
has been flipped over.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.800
Repeat, the horseshoe
has been flipped over.

00:03:42.733 --> 00:03:43.733
So it begins!

00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:48.333
Point F-209.
The Metia Republic, Port Garbo!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.700
Change course.
Head for the border!

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:52.770
Roger!

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.930
Your knockout technique?

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:09.370
Right. A name for my knockout technique.
I need a name to get fired up.

00:04:09.666 --> 00:04:12.566
Everyone else has names,
spells and stuff.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.430
So I was thinking it's about time
I came up with some cool name.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.100
Is that how it is?

00:04:18.466 --> 00:04:22.466
Killer Bat has the Hornet Pierce.
Minotaur has the Waves of Rage.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.730
Mine's the Blitz Claw, maro!

00:04:24.966 --> 00:04:28.066
The enemy Shadow Wielders also shout out
some kind of technique names, so...

00:04:28.266 --> 00:04:32.366
Hey Shu, as your fiancÃ©e,
shall I think of something for you?

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.630
You're not my fiancÃ©e, I tell you.

00:04:34.666 --> 00:04:36.926
Then, I'll think of
something for you, maro!

00:04:36.966 --> 00:04:40.766
No thanks. You'd probably
come up with some weird name.

00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:42.303
That's mean.

00:04:42.333 --> 00:04:43.673
How rude, maro.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:45.870
Zola...

00:04:46.633 --> 00:04:49.303
They have no sense of urgency.

00:04:49.333 --> 00:04:51.933
Do you really intend on going
to Grankingdom with them?

00:04:52.466 --> 00:04:55.126
Whether or not they go
is up to them.

00:04:55.333 --> 00:04:56.603
I'll go!

00:04:56.833 --> 00:05:00.533
I've got to decide on a name
before we get to the Grankingdom.

00:05:00.766 --> 00:05:02.126
I'll go too, maro!

00:05:02.266 --> 00:05:02.926
Me too!

00:05:03.266 --> 00:05:06.996
I'm going if Shu's going.
I'm his fiancÃ©e!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.000
What will you do?

00:05:10.166 --> 00:05:11.566
Of course I'm going!

00:05:12.166 --> 00:05:16.666
Why do you think I put up with
all that training and traveled this far?

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.870
Then it's settled.

00:05:24.633 --> 00:05:26.933
Guys, first look at this.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.330
Presently we're here.

00:05:29.733 --> 00:05:33.603
And this is the border between
Metia and Grankingdom.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.730
After we cross there,
we'll be in Grankingdom at last.

00:05:37.933 --> 00:05:42.173
Our destination is the capital
of Grankingdom, The City.

00:05:42.566 --> 00:05:43.896
That's where Nene is.

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:47.770
It's probably safe to say it's
the heart of Grankingdom's power,

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:50.800
where they artificially
create the Shadows,

00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:54.473
produce the robots that summon
the Shadows, and so much more.

00:05:55.166 --> 00:05:58.966
Is that where Nene keeps the children
he kidnapped from all around the world?

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:01.130
Perhaps...

00:06:02.966 --> 00:06:05.196
That was just about
to happen to us, too.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.200
Damn that Nene!

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:10.526
Unforgivable, maro!
I'll kick his butt, maro!

00:06:10.566 --> 00:06:12.226
I know you're probably
aware of this,

00:06:12.266 --> 00:06:14.366
but when we cross over,
we'll be in enemy territory.

00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:17.926
We could be attacked by his forces
at any time and any where.

00:06:19.566 --> 00:06:20.566
Bad vibes...

00:06:20.833 --> 00:06:23.773
We don't even know if we can
safely cross the border.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:27.400
Since Grankingdom is taking
aggressive military action,

00:06:27.433 --> 00:06:30.333
they'll be on the lookout for
an invasion across the border.

00:06:31.233 --> 00:06:35.673
They have large numbers of
roving patrols along the roads.

00:06:36.566 --> 00:06:38.996
We must avoid unnecessary battle
as much as possible.

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:45.303
So we will infiltrate Grankingdom
going through here.

00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:47.326
What kind of place is it?

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:48.900
There's a few canyons.

00:06:49.366 --> 00:06:50.026
Right.

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:54.130
There are countless deep crevices
in this whole area.

00:06:55.166 --> 00:06:59.066
It would be almost impossible for
ordinary people to infiltrate from here.

00:07:00.133 --> 00:07:01.273
Which means...

00:07:01.633 --> 00:07:03.603
Their security forces
will be very light, right?

00:07:04.233 --> 00:07:05.373
Exactly.

00:07:05.633 --> 00:07:08.273
We'll infiltrate Grankingdom
taking this route

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:11.400
and maximizing
our Shadow powers.

00:07:12.166 --> 00:07:12.826
Got it?

00:07:13.333 --> 00:07:14.003
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:14.903
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:07:15.533 --> 00:07:19.003
Now, let's set up a rendezvous point
in case we get separated.

00:07:28.833 --> 00:07:32.633
We are going to wipe out the Shadow
Wielders who are coming here.

00:07:33.066 --> 00:07:37.866
Our target is the Independent
Flying Squadron's top priority.

00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:43.273
These enemies could inflict unlimited
damage on Grankingdom in the future.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.600
Top priority, huh?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.030
But they're just kids, right?

00:07:49.433 --> 00:07:52.973
They're also the ones we've been
ordered directly by Lord Nene to eliminate.

00:07:53.766 --> 00:07:56.366
If we get careless,
it'll be Dragnov all over again

00:07:56.733 --> 00:07:58.133
The Black Shadow, huh?

00:07:58.533 --> 00:08:01.733
What can robots like that do?

00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:03.833
I'll be involved as well this time.

00:08:06.133 --> 00:08:07.133
General Logi...

00:08:07.666 --> 00:08:10.796
We'll be meeting up with
Schneider and Lemaire soon.

00:08:11.166 --> 00:08:12.526
Leave this to us.

00:08:12.633 --> 00:08:14.703
Sorry, but I'll be doing this my way.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.970
There's something I want to verify
with my own eyes, too.

00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:42.273
It'll be right after we cross here.

00:08:42.933 --> 00:08:44.233
Let's go, guys!

00:09:19.266 --> 00:09:21.366
Oh, Shu! I'm scared.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.670
You can make
your Shadow appear too.

00:09:24.966 --> 00:09:25.626
Let's go!

00:09:29.566 --> 00:09:31.166
Yahoooooo.

00:09:32.566 --> 00:09:34.066
Getting all carried away...

00:09:37.933 --> 00:09:38.973
Up you go.

00:09:40.033 --> 00:09:41.933
Thanks, Jiro and Minotaur.

00:09:47.066 --> 00:09:48.066
Stay sharp.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.770
Now comes the tough part.

00:09:50.233 --> 00:09:51.833
Then this is already...

00:09:52.033 --> 00:09:54.103
Yeah, we've crossed the border.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.300
We're already within
the Grankingdom territory.

00:10:02.433 --> 00:10:04.273
Nene's up ahead, huh?

00:10:06.166 --> 00:10:06.826
Maro?!

00:10:18.733 --> 00:10:20.003
Maro!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.000
Kluke! Marumaro!

00:10:23.266 --> 00:10:25.366
Saber Tiger!

00:10:27.033 --> 00:10:28.533
Maro!

00:10:29.566 --> 00:10:30.226
Whoops.

00:10:30.933 --> 00:10:32.203
Nice, Marumaro!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.500
Is everyone safe?

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.330
Head to the rendezvous point, alright?!

00:10:37.133 --> 00:10:38.833
I'll draw the enemy's attention!

00:10:55.666 --> 00:10:56.766
Shadow Wielders?!

00:11:00.433 --> 00:11:01.433
That guy!

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:09.030
General Logi...

00:11:09.566 --> 00:11:11.466
He's strong, maro!

00:11:11.766 --> 00:11:14.166
Let's head for the rendezvous point,
Marumaro!

00:11:14.433 --> 00:11:15.603
But, maro...

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:19.070
Zola told us to avoid
unnecessary battle, right?

00:11:20.566 --> 00:11:21.666
Okay, maro!

00:11:22.466 --> 00:11:23.526
You too, Shu! Hurry!

00:11:24.933 --> 00:11:26.503
Zola will be okay.

00:11:27.766 --> 00:11:30.866
Right. It's Nene we're after!

00:11:43.533 --> 00:11:44.973
Start the operation.

00:12:19.133 --> 00:12:20.673
Feather Storm!

00:12:23.166 --> 00:12:23.826
Zola!

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:26.800
Bouquet, you go on ahead!
I'll help Zola.

00:12:27.066 --> 00:12:29.566
But Zola said to go to
the rendezvous point!

00:12:29.833 --> 00:12:33.473
The enemy is General Logi!
Zola's in serious trouble just by herself!

00:12:33.666 --> 00:12:36.696
Oh my, do you have the luxury
to worry about others?

00:12:39.833 --> 00:12:42.103
You thought you were hiding well?

00:12:42.633 --> 00:12:46.133
You're also a Shadow Wielder,
right, pretty boy?

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:49.730
I'll wait for you, so hurry up
and summon your Shadow.

00:12:50.166 --> 00:12:51.296
Knock it off!

00:12:54.966 --> 00:12:55.626
Go!

00:12:56.133 --> 00:12:57.133
R-Right.

00:12:59.233 --> 00:13:01.433
My name is Cynthia.

00:13:02.566 --> 00:13:05.396
And this is my Shadow, Yarovit.

00:13:05.833 --> 00:13:07.003
Nice to meet you.

00:13:34.366 --> 00:13:37.796
Gilliam, Targets Three,
Four and Five are on the move.

00:13:38.466 --> 00:13:40.366
Leave Zola to Lemaire
and go after them.

00:13:40.666 --> 00:13:44.226
Yes, sir. Then we'll go
as planned, Euphir!

00:13:46.666 --> 00:13:47.326
What?!

00:13:57.833 --> 00:13:59.203
Let's go, Minotaur!

00:13:59.533 --> 00:14:01.133
Roger.

00:14:01.533 --> 00:14:04.403
Come on. I'll play with you.

00:14:17.833 --> 00:14:20.003
Andropov, can you hear me?

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:21.630
Yes, I can hear you.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:30.730
The enemy forces are dispersing,
General Logi.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:33.100
They moved fast without hesitation.

00:14:33.166 --> 00:14:36.026
In other words, they probably have
a meeting location established.

00:14:37.133 --> 00:14:39.133
I don't think so, Zola.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.730
All members, get support
from Andropov as needed.

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:47.630
Follow your targets, but don't get too close.
Let them make their next move first.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:48.770
Roger!

00:14:49.533 --> 00:14:52.233
Get support from Andropov?
Never!

00:14:52.566 --> 00:14:55.466
It's not like I'm doing it
because I like it, Cynthia.

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:58.970
One girl escaped!
Did you know?!

00:14:59.433 --> 00:15:02.233
Of course. Someone is
already on the way.

00:15:03.033 --> 00:15:04.633
I won't let her get away.

00:15:11.933 --> 00:15:13.973
I won't let you guys get away.

00:15:14.333 --> 00:15:15.003
Maro!

00:15:15.966 --> 00:15:18.066
Saber Tiger.

00:15:21.033 --> 00:15:23.533
Marumaro, take Kluke
and go on ahead.

00:15:24.366 --> 00:15:25.026
Shu!

00:15:25.466 --> 00:15:26.996
I'll beat this guy!

00:15:28.066 --> 00:15:31.466
Oh-ho.
This is the kid in the report.

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:33.530
Sorry.

00:15:34.966 --> 00:15:36.326
Wind Scream!

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.070
Shu!

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.970
This jerk, maro!

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:51.270
It seems the Shadow's
strength is the speed.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:54.330
But I wonder how long
he can keep up with Euphir.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.930
You're no match for Saber Tiger, maro!

00:15:58.133 --> 00:16:01.403
Well, I'll let you guys entertain me.

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:02.570
Lemaire!

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.400
Do you plan to get involved
in this fight at all?

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:09.200
We've got a fast one here.
It has to be me to cover him.

00:16:09.966 --> 00:16:11.326
I know.

00:16:11.866 --> 00:16:14.066
Allow me to be
Miss Zola's opponent.

00:16:17.966 --> 00:16:20.666
Not bad, pretty boy.

00:16:20.933 --> 00:16:25.133
I'm not a boy.
You'll regret it if you take me lightly.

00:16:25.633 --> 00:16:29.473
Oh my, you're tough.
I like you even more.

00:16:29.733 --> 00:16:33.233
But I wonder how long
you'll stay tough.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:40.130
You're the popular one, Jiro.
But she doesn't look like she'll be easy.

00:16:40.433 --> 00:16:43.803
Entertain me. A lot.

00:16:44.166 --> 00:16:45.166
Shut up!

00:16:47.166 --> 00:16:50.466
Great. Let's play more, boy!

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:57.800
Nobody can escape from
my Alfheim's eyes.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:58.970
Oops.

00:16:59.866 --> 00:17:06.766
Target Six is approaching you.
Authorizing it now as your target. Okay?

00:17:07.166 --> 00:17:09.596
Understood. I have her in my sights.

00:17:13.133 --> 00:17:16.133
Entertain me, cute little girl.

00:17:18.633 --> 00:17:19.303
Jiro!

00:17:20.433 --> 00:17:22.133
I didn't expect Logi and
his henchmen to show up

00:17:22.166 --> 00:17:23.826
as soon as we
entered the country.

00:17:24.566 --> 00:17:25.866
I made a serious
miscalculation here.

00:17:26.433 --> 00:17:28.333
We need to rethink our strategy.

00:17:28.933 --> 00:17:32.403
It couldn't be a coincidence that
they were staking out this route.

00:17:33.966 --> 00:17:35.766
Oww...

00:17:36.066 --> 00:17:38.296
Damn it.
Blowing me away like that...

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:39.470
Shu!

00:17:40.466 --> 00:17:41.126
Zola!

00:17:41.966 --> 00:17:44.666
We'll end up dying for nothing
if we fight here.

00:17:45.166 --> 00:17:46.166
We're going to escape.

00:17:46.833 --> 00:17:48.003
Are Kluke and the others okay?

00:17:48.266 --> 00:17:50.866
Marumaro and Saber Tiger
are with her.

00:17:51.833 --> 00:17:56.733
We're up against General Logi.
He's a master at making battle plans.

00:17:57.933 --> 00:18:01.273
We have no chance against him
without any strategy.

00:18:02.033 --> 00:18:05.103
What is he?
Is he an acquaintance of yours?

00:18:06.433 --> 00:18:08.003
How are you connected?

00:18:08.566 --> 00:18:10.996
I'm also interested in that.

00:18:13.133 --> 00:18:15.003
I'd love to know the answer.

00:18:15.966 --> 00:18:17.066
Shu, go!

00:18:17.433 --> 00:18:18.103
What?

00:18:18.333 --> 00:18:21.703
I can handle this level
of opponent by myself.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:25.130
Meet up with the others
and tell them it's plan C.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:26.700
Plan C!

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:28.570
Which is what again?

00:18:29.266 --> 00:18:31.566
They'll know when you tell them!
Now get moving!

00:18:31.933 --> 00:18:32.933
Got it!

00:18:34.766 --> 00:18:39.126
General Logi, the kid in question
is moving to point N as planned.

00:18:39.433 --> 00:18:40.103
Roger.

00:18:44.766 --> 00:18:45.866
He's going to catch up!

00:18:46.133 --> 00:18:47.633
Saber Tiger!

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:51.500
Please hang on tight!
I'm speeding up!

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:52.270
Right!

00:18:56.633 --> 00:18:59.373
How about it, maro?!
We lost him, maro!

00:19:01.733 --> 00:19:02.933
Is that all?

00:19:03.833 --> 00:19:06.403
I thought I heard you say you were
going to speed up or something.

00:19:06.866 --> 00:19:08.966
I hope that's not all you've got.

00:19:09.033 --> 00:19:10.033
Maro...

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:14.930
You can't escape Euphir like that!

00:19:15.333 --> 00:19:17.733
This isn't over, maro!
Just you watch, maro!

00:19:22.866 --> 00:19:25.066
Andropov, where is Target Three?

00:19:25.666 --> 00:19:29.096
Moving west through point N2477.

00:19:29.866 --> 00:19:32.396
I think he's going to meet up
with Targets Four and Five.

00:19:33.566 --> 00:19:37.396
I'm upset.
You have so little respect for my skills.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:49.130
My name is Lemaire.
And my Shadow is Deucalion.

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.300
I'm very glad to make
your acquaintance.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:55.600
There's no point in knowing the name
of someone who's about to die.

00:19:59.633 --> 00:20:00.303
What?!

00:20:00.466 --> 00:20:03.466
Just like General Logi,
I also use a sword.

00:20:04.133 --> 00:20:07.333
I know you don't have respect for my skills,
but you should never be too careless!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:10.730
How about this!

00:20:13.033 --> 00:20:14.103
You've got a long way to go.

00:20:14.366 --> 00:20:15.026
No way...

00:20:15.266 --> 00:20:15.926
Maro...

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.200
I still haven't introduced myself.

00:20:18.733 --> 00:20:21.533
My name is Gilliam.
Remember that.

00:20:22.566 --> 00:20:24.226
Saber Tiger!

00:20:29.033 --> 00:20:31.903
What's the matter?
Is the game of tag over already?

00:20:32.466 --> 00:20:36.226
We represent justice.
Justice doesn't run or hide!

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:38.430
You're a smart-aleck, maro!

00:20:39.133 --> 00:20:43.973
I just made you realize that
there's always someone better.

00:20:44.533 --> 00:20:45.903
Maro...

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.800
Since we can't run,
we just have to fight, maro.

00:20:50.133 --> 00:20:51.133
Marumaro...

00:20:52.866 --> 00:20:54.726
What's the matter?
You're not going to attack?

00:20:55.066 --> 00:20:58.366
Then...I'll attack first!

00:21:01.133 --> 00:21:06.033
And one more thing.
I have no intention of dying here.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.500
Riot!

00:21:11.233 --> 00:21:12.233
Oh, no!

00:21:15.866 --> 00:21:16.526
What's this?!

00:21:19.933 --> 00:21:21.173
What's the big idea?

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:25.100
Battle must be beautiful and thrilling.

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:28.170
I thought it'd be more elegant this way
than just fighting.

00:21:29.033 --> 00:21:33.103
Interesting...
But don't regret it.

00:21:33.166 --> 00:21:36.566
Right back at you!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:42.070
Whoa!

00:21:49.833 --> 00:21:51.603
Another Shadow Wielder, huh?

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.170
How many of you are there?!

00:21:54.766 --> 00:21:58.266
We're the Independent Flying Squadron
under General Logi's command.

00:21:58.666 --> 00:22:00.896
You guys are mice caught in a trap.

00:22:01.366 --> 00:22:06.196
You've got nowhere to run.
As long as Alfheim and I are here.

00:22:12.533 --> 00:22:17.773
I was told to run, but I've reached my limit!
Let's fight, Blue Dragon!

00:22:20.766 --> 00:22:21.426
What is it?

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:24.470
Blue Dragon, huh?

00:22:32.833 --> 00:22:34.633
General Logi...

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:37.930
The power that defeated
Gustov and Ivanov...

00:22:39.466 --> 00:22:40.996
Show it to me!

00:24:21.333 --> 00:24:23.203
Having played
into Logi's hands,

00:24:23.266 --> 00:24:25.766
Shu and friends make
their final effort to escape.

00:24:25.900 --> 00:24:27.670
Our only hope is to transform, maro!

00:24:27.700 --> 00:24:28.700
What do you mean?

00:24:28.733 --> 00:24:32.573
Combine Kluke' face, Bouquet's body,
and Zola's arms and legs, maro!

00:24:32.766 --> 00:24:34.866
I'd prefer to be the face.

00:24:35.000 --> 00:24:36.170
Please, don't...

00:24:36.366 --> 00:24:39.126
Next on Blue Dragon:
"Escape through the Enemy Front."
